  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cash Assistance and Case Management Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this grant is to provide front-line rapid response to vulnerable members of key populations (KPS) in Uganda through intake, verification and case management, referral to trusted service providers, and the provision of multi-purpose cash assistance where no safe and quality referral options are possible.</narrative>
  </description>
